## 16. Remediation Priority

- P0 → Remove plaintext secrets, disable insecure flags  
- P1 → Enable TLS and validation  
- P2 → Improve alignment and config quality  

---

## 17. Quality Rules (NON-NEGOTIABLE)

- No hallucination  
- No missing evidence  
- No unredacted secrets  
- No assumptions  

Must be:
- Deterministic  
- Auditable  
- Reproducible  

---

## 18. Execution Flow

Inventory → CD Validation → CI Validation → Reconciliation → Evidence → JSON Output
